== Notes ==

* There is an extra point of damage per arrow in addition to what is stated in the spell's description, except when cast with [[maximize spell]]. (That is, damage is actually 4d6+1 per arrow, but each arrow's damage is only 24 when maximized.)
* [[Saving throw]]s and spell resistance checks are made for each arrow of this spell.
* Since spell resistance is applied to each arrow individually, this spell is more effective than most when it comes to using up an opponent's [[spell mantle]]s, as each arrow will reduce that protection by three spell levels. At higher caster levels (16+), this spell can eat more mantle levels with a single casting than any<!-- or is it just most? --> other spell. (This behavior is changed by the set of spell changes<sup>[http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3739]</sup> that has been linked to as a "set of fixes" elsewhere in this wiki, even though there is no reason to believe this behavior is not intended.)
* When cast by a level 40 mage, this spell just edges out ''[[Isaac's greater missile storm]]'' and ''[[hellball]]'' for the greatest damage (40d6+10) potentially inflicted on a single target by a spell.

